{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"The only runtime change since round 19 removes the rejection of bases with unavailable material bindings. I’m checking whether `material_clean` remains a sufficient witness, and whether delivery consumers preserve the head where each carried check ran. The report-provenance issue and missing end-to-end fixture are still documented as F2 and F1."}}
