{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"command_execution","command":"/usr/bin/bash -lc 'pose validate --help'","aggregated_output":"POSE - validate\n\nExecute the deterministic validation matrix across all modules\n\nUsage:\n  pose validate [--strict|--tolerant] [--stack <s>] [--module <p>] [--report] [--json-out <path>] [--jobs <n>] [--verbose]\n\nDescription:\n  Executes deterministic verification commands (tests, linters, typechecks, builds) declared in .pose/indexes/validation-matrix.json.\n\nOptions / Flags:\n  --strict                 Fail on any error or structural validation warning (default in CI)\n  --tolerant               Allow non-blocking warnings while failing on required errors\n  --stack <name>           Filter execution to modules matching the given stack (e.g. go, node, python)\n  --module <path>          Filter execution to a specific module directory path\n  --report                 Persist validation findings into .pose/reports/\n  --json-out <path>        Write structured validation outcome to the specified JSON path\n  --json <path>            Deprecated alias of --json-out <path>\n  --changed-from <rev>     Validate only modules affected between git revisions\n  --jobs <n>               Run up to n checks at once (default: from cores and available memory)\n  --verbose                Stream each check's output as it runs; by default it is captured and a failing check's tail is shown\n\nExamples:\n  $ pose validate --strict\n  $ pose validate --module pose-mcp --verbose\n  $ pose validate --module pose-mcp --strict\n  $ pose validate --json-out .pose/results/delivery-validation.json\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"command_execution","command":"/usr/bin/bash -lc \"go -C pose-mcp test ./internal/pose -run TestDeliveryValidationRunReadsTheCarriedHead; git status --short; rg -n 'func Test|unavailable' pose-mcp/internal/cli/validate_carry_test.go\"","aggregated_output":"ok  \tgithub.com/harne8/pose-mcp/internal/pose\t0.004s\n M .pose/assessments/integrations.md\n M .pose/assessments/technical-debt.md\n M .pose/state/integrations.json\n M .pose/state/technical-debt.json\n127:func TestCarryRunsOnlyTheChangedModule(t *testing.T) {\n156:func TestCarryKeepsTheOriginalHeadAcrossChainedCarries(t *testing.T) {\n173:func TestCarryKeepsACarriedFailureAFailure(t *testing.T) {\n189:func TestCarryFallsBackToAFullRun(t *testing.T) {\n242:func TestCarryRootChangeRunsEverythingUnlessSelfContained(t *testing.T) {\n265:func TestChangedScopeHonoursSelfContainedModules(t *testing.T) {\n274:func TestCarryRecordFileIsNotAChange(t *testing.T) {\n283:func TestCarrySelectsAModuleWithoutAPriorResult(t *testing.T) {\n309:func TestCarryRefusesAFilteredBase(t *testing.T) {\n321:func TestCarryRefusesIncompatibleFlags(t *testing.T) {\n334:func TestCarryIgnoresDerivedAdministrativeRecords(t *testing.T) {\n355:func TestCarryRefusesABaseThatValidatedADirtyWorkingCopy(t *testing.T) {\n378:func TestCarrySelectsBothSidesOfARename(t *testing.T) {\n395:func TestCarryKeepsTheOwnerOfAQuotedName(t *testing.T) {\n411:func TestCarryRootModuleOwnsRootFiles(t *testing.T) {\n429:func TestCarryDeletedDependencySelectsItsDependents(t *testing.T) {\n445:func TestCarryRejectsUndecodableMetadata(t *testing.T) {\n461:func TestChangedScopeGitlinkAboveADependencySelectsItsDependents(t *testing.T) {\n477:func TestCarryDeletedNestedDependencySelectsItsDependents(t *testing.T) {\n492:func TestCarryRootDependencyIsChangedByRootFiles(t *testing.T) {\n507:func TestCarryRefusesModulesReachedThroughASymlink(t *testing.T) {\n526:func TestValidateHeadMovingDuringTheRunIsNotClean(t *testing