{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"agent_message","text":"The focused CLI tests, delivery-reader test, and `go vet` passed. I found a new documentation mismatch: both manuals and their embedded copies still say an unavailable material binding disqualifies a base, although the code now allows it.\n\nThe assessment commands also wrote generated records despite the read-only task boundary. I’m restoring those files to their original bytes and will use the sealed assessment evidence for the conclusion."}}
